{"id": "56954", "title": "情网", "author": "不详", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 3, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/56/56954.htm", "intro": "第一章\r\n\r\n初夏的阳光像情人的手指尖抚摸着玛沙裸露的皮肤。她像一只猫一样非常舒适地翻了一个身，搜寻理查德肉体的温暖。", "base": "files/article/html/56/56954", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章", "file": "8016842.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "8016843.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "8016846.html", "available": false}]}